{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0nmdk7yd","slide":2,"name":"section-0-item-1","text":"2、功能主治：清热解毒。用于小儿痱毒，暑热口渴","textPreview":"2、功能主治：清热解毒。用于小儿痱毒，暑热口渴","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[525,177,710,36]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fmtcr2xs","slide":2,"name":"section-0-item-2","text":"3、用法用量：口服。一次60～120毫升，一日2～3次。","textPreview":"3、用法用量：口服。一次60～120毫升，一日2～3次。","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[525,213,710,36]}
